    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Step into the eerie aftermath of a failed reactor . The power plant is now a desolate ruin, and your team\u2019s mission is to restore it to operational status while dealing with both environmental hazards and lurking threats. Engage in a fresh set of challenges as you attempt to reactivate and stabilize the plant, all while combating the encroaching danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Post-Apocalyptic Environment</strong>: Explore and restore the dilapidated Nova-6 plant.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Restoration Challenges</strong>: Solve unique puzzles and overcome obstacles to reactivate critical systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Increased Threats</strong>: Face new dangers and environmental hazards in the abandoned plant.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Planning</strong>: Develop strategies to restore the plant while managing limited resources and time.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you succeed in keeping the Nova-6 power plant operational in overcome the challenges ? Trust your team, stay alert, and prepare for intense cooperative gameplay in Core Containment.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Step into the eerie aftermath of a failed reactor . The power plant is now a desolate ruin, and your team\u2019s mission is to restore it to operational status while dealing with both environmental hazards and lurking threats. Engage in a fresh set of challenges as you attempt to reactivate and stabilize the plant, all while combating the encroaching danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Post-Apocalyptic Environment</strong>: Explore and restore the dilapidated Nova-6 plant.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Restoration Challenges</strong>: Solve unique puzzles and overcome obstacles to reactivate critical systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Increased Threats</strong>: Face new dangers and environmental hazards in the abandoned plant.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Planning</strong>: Develop strategies to restore the plant while managing limited resources and time.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you succeed in keeping the Nova-6 power plant operational in overcome the challenges ? Trust your team, stay alert, and prepare for intense cooperative gameplay in Core Containment.</p>",
    "short_description": "Core Containment is a cooperative game set in the Nova-6 nuclear power plant. Team up to prevent a meltdown while dealing with a hidden saboteur in Standard Mode. In Abandoned Mode, restore the desolate plant and tackle new challenges. Trust and strategy are crucial for survival.",
